Sanctum.
This game is seriously fun when its you and your friends battling it out against hordes of enemys. Actually, you dont even need friends for it to be fun, you can just join a game and its still a good experience. This game is great, challenging, gorgeous and most of all, a huge waste of time - BUT WHO CARES ITS AWESOME. there is no leveling feature for playing the game excesivly, but that can be forgived, as this game excells in almost all other categories. There are a good selection of unique weapons and an even greater selection of towers. the animations are still good however the killing of the enemys is a bit rediculous, they either drop dead or explode; its pretty funny though. I deffinetly reccomend to every person on this planet this game, as many hours of fun can be milked from it.
Have fun, and remeber to always use the sniper - its too good. C;

This game mixes what Dark souls has from ambient(including enemies, weapons, objects, armours...) with a metroidvania gameplay style. If you liked dark souls you ll surely like this game. The maps are splendid and intertwined intelligently.
About the bad things, the game is short for my liking (around 20 hours for the first playthrough), the coop and PVP is offline, not online, and the design is made to kill you in every corner... if thats considered bad ;)
if you have any doubt you can always ask me directly :)

